{
  "uid": "suntzu-rc-traces",
  "title": "SunTzu RC · 5 Trazas",
  "description": "Las peticiones tramo a tramo: lo más lento, las consultas SQL, los errores y el buscador por trace ID.",
  "tags": ["suntzu-rc"],
  "editable": true,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "5m",
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": ["5m", "15m", "30m", "1h"]
  },
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "SunTzu RC",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": ["suntzu-rc"],
      "asDropdown": false,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Trazas: ¿dónde se fue el tiempo?\nCada petición deja una **traza**: sus tramos (spans) en la web, en la API y en cada consulta SQL, con el mismo `traceId`. Se guardan en `aws/spans` 30 días. Para seguir una petición concreta, pega su `x-request-id` (cabecera de respuesta de la API) en **Trace ID** arriba."
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Una petición concreta",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Tramos de la traza",
      "description": "Escribe un trace ID arriba (32 caracteres). Ordenados por inicio: ms es lo que tardó cada tramo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:aws/spans",
              "name": "aws/spans"
            }
          ],
          "logGroupNames": ["aws/spans"],
          "expression": "filter traceId = \"${trace_id}\"\n| fields startTimeUnixNano, durationNano / 1000000 as ms, resource.attributes.service.name as servicio, kind, name as tramo, status.code as estado, attributes.db.query.text as sql\n| sort startTimeUnixNano asc\n| limit 200",
          "statsGroups": [],
          "queryLanguage": "CWLI",
          "id": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "startTimeUnixNano"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.hidden",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "ms"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ms"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "gauge",
                  "mode": "basic"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 16
      },
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Lo más lento",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Páginas y rutas más lentas",
      "description": "Tramos de entrada (SERVER) de la web y la API: cuántas veces, mediana (p50) y p95 en milisegundos.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:aws/spans",
              "name": "aws/spans"
            }
          ],
          "logGroupNames": ["aws/spans"],
          "expression": "filter kind = \"SERVER\" and resource.attributes.deployment.environment.name = \"${env}\"\n| stats count(*) as veces, pct(durationNano, 50) / 1000000 as p50_ms, pct(durationNano, 95) / 1000000 as p95_ms, max(durationNano) / 1000000 as max_ms by resource.attributes.service.name as servicio, name as ruta\n| sort p95_ms desc\n| limit 30",
          "statsGroups": [],
          "queryLanguage": "CWLI",
          "id": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "id": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Consultas SQL más lentas",
      "description": "Cada consulta a PostgreSQL (con $1, $2… en lugar de los valores). Ordenadas por tiempo total: veces × media.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:aws/spans",
              "name": "aws/spans"
            }
          ],
          "logGroupNames": ["aws/spans"],
          "expression": "filter attributes.db.system.name = \"postgresql\" and resource.attributes.deployment.environment.name = \"${env}\"\n| stats count(*) as veces, avg(durationNano) / 1000000 as media_ms, max(durationNano) / 1000000 as max_ms, sum(durationNano) / 1000000 as total_ms by substr(attributes.db.query.text, 0, 160) as consulta\n| sort total_ms desc\n| limit 30",
          "statsGroups": [],
          "queryLanguage": "CWLI",
          "id": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "id": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "En el tiempo",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Peticiones trazadas por servicio",
      "description": "Tramos de entrada por servicio cada 15 min.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:aws/spans",
              "name": "aws/spans"
            }
          ],
          "logGroupNames": ["aws/spans"],
          "expression": "filter kind = \"SERVER\" and resource.attributes.deployment.environment.name = \"${env}\"\n| stats count(*) as peticiones by bin(15m), resource.attributes.service.name as servicio",
          "statsGroups": ["servicio"],
          "queryLanguage": "CWLI",
          "id": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "id": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p95 por servicio (ms)",
      "description": "El 95% de las peticiones tardan menos que esto.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:aws/spans",
              "name": "aws/spans"
            }
          ],
          "logGroupNames": ["aws/spans"],
          "expression": "filter kind = \"SERVER\" and resource.attributes.deployment.environment.name = \"${env}\"\n| stats pct(durationNano, 95) / 1000000 as p95_ms by bin(15m), resource.attributes.service.name as servicio",
          "statsGroups": ["servicio"],
          "queryLanguage": "CWLI",
          "id": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "id": 9
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Errores",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 10
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Tramos con error",
      "description": "Tramos marcados como ERROR. Copia su traceId en el buscador de arriba para ver la petición entera.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:aws/spans",
              "name": "aws/spans"
            }
          ],
          "logGroupNames": ["aws/spans"],
          "expression": "filter status.code = \"ERROR\" and resource.attributes.deployment.environment.name = \"${env}\"\n| fields @timestamp, resource.attributes.service.name as servicio, name as tramo, durationNano / 1000000 as ms, traceId\n| sort @timestamp desc\n| limit 50",
          "statsGroups": [],
          "queryLanguage": "CWLI",
          "id": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 41,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "id": 11
    }
  ],
